OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey insisted
OL,7,Fpolicies already announced are fully
OL,8,Ffunded, but he appeared to leave the
OL,9,Fdoor open for tax rises, as ITV News'
OL,10,FLewis Dennison reports
OL,12,FThe chancellor has refused to rule out
OL,13,Fany tax rises in the upcoming Budget,
OL,14,Fbut promised to give businesses and
OL,15,Ffamilies "breathing room", in an
OL,16,Fexclusive interview with ITV News.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
