OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,FJohn Healey, newly in Number 11 after
OL,7,Fbeing appointed by Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham, insisted policies already
OL,9,Fannounced - such as cutting
OL,10,Fhospitality business rates and
OL,11,Fremoving VAT on energy bills - are
OL,12,Ffully funded, but he appeared to leave
OL,13,Fthe door open for tax rises to fund
OL,14,Ffurther cost-of-living measures.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,F"We can't relieve people of all the
OL,7,Fcost of living pressures or the cost
OL,8,Fof business pressures, but we
OL,9,Frecognise them, and we'll do what we
OL,10,Fcan to give people just a little bit
OL,11,Fof breathing space," he told Political
OL,12,FReporter Lewis Denison.
OL,14,FWhen asked if that meant tax rises in
OL,15,Fthe Budget at the end of October, he
OL,16,Fsaid: "The announcements we've made as
OL,17,Fa new government in the last few
OL,18,Fweeks, we know how we're going to pay
OL,19,Ffor them.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,F"In the Budget, I'll set out a whole
OL,7,Fplan for the economy, plans for
OL,8,Ftaxation, plans for the future, and
OL,9,Fthat will be how we'd get activity."
OL,11,FThe chancellor was speaking to ITV
OL,12,FNews from the Chantry Brewery in
OL,13,FRotherham in his constituency, to
OL,14,Fpromote his 20% business rates cut for
OL,15,Fpubs, clubs and venues.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,FHe accepted the tax cut alone will not
OL,7,Fbe enough to reverse the trend of pub
OL,8,Fclosures, after the Campaign for Real
OL,9,FAle said 794 have closed their doors
OL,10,Fso far this year, suggesting further
OL,11,Fhelp could be on the horizon.
OL,13,FHealey insisted the cut announced
OL,14,Falongside Burnham in the first week of
OL,15,Fthe new government "did give people
OL,16,Fsome hope", but added: "It's not going
OL,17,Fto guarantee their future, but it is
OL,18,Fgoing to give them just a bit of
OL,19,Fbreathing space."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
