PN,31206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,FHe said he and the PM "recognise the
OL,7,Fpressure that pubs and other
OL,8,Fbusinesses are on" and have a "desire
OL,9,Fto give businesses some breathing
OL,10,Fspace from the pressures that they
OL,11,Fface".
OL,13,F"We know those are high. We know those
OL,14,Fare tough. We want to relieve the cost
OL,15,Fof business as we can, just as we do
OL,16,Fthe cost of living."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
