OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,FAsked if he could bring in any
OL,7,Fpolicies which reduce the price of a
OL,8,Fpint in the pub, the chancellor said:
OL,9,F"I don't set the price of pints, but I
OL,10,Fcan recognise that where there are
OL,11,Fcost of business, we can do some
OL,12,Fthings to help relieve and where we
OL,13,Fcan, we will."
OL,15,FIt came after Burnham asked small
OL,16,Fbusinesses how the government can help
OL,17,Fthem plan for the long term.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
