OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,FThe 20% rates relief for pubs and
OL,7,Fother similar venues was among the
OL,8,Ffirst announcements Burnham made when
OL,9,Fhe came into office, as part of a
OL,10,Fseries of cost of living-related
OL,11,Fmeasures.
OL,13,FThe prime minister said ahead of the
OL,14,Fvisit: "Local businesses are the
OL,15,Fbeating heart of our communities,
OL,16,Fbringing life to the places we call
OL,17,Fhome.
OL,26,@vD@HOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786781885
OL,3,CPubs, pints and taxes: Chancellor John
OL,4,CHealey sits down with ITV News
OL,6,F"We are helping pubs, social clubs and
OL,7,Flive music venues by cutting their
OL,8,Fbusiness rates, but I've always said
OL,9,Fthere is more to do.
OL,11,F"I'm listening to small business
OL,12,Fowners so we can work together to
OL,13,Fdeliver jobs and growth in every
OL,14,Fpostcode."
OL,16,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,17,Four political experts are across all
OL,18,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,19,Fto the latest episode below...
